  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Tech Stack**\n\nI\'ve decided on Vite with React 19, along with Tailwind v4, Lucide icons, and motion libraries. I\'ll use Express as the backend, and TypeScript with TSX for the development language.\n\n\n**Refining the Design Concept**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the visual direction, aiming for an Indian news portal aesthetic, but unique. I\'ll need to use placeholders, especially for copyrighted assets. The goal is a clean, modular structure using Next.js 15+ (App Router), TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. The design will be inspired by ABP Live. I\'ll include a README for setup and deployment to Vercel.\n\n\n**Verifying the Setup**\n\nI\'ve confirmed Vite runs the app with React 19, enabling seamless routing and state management for diverse routes like `/`, `/category/[slug]`, etc. Hindi/English bilingual font support (Hind, Noto Sans Devanagari) via Google Fonts has also been confirmed to render authentic Hindi text. I\'ve also checked metadata, including the site name \"Bharat Samachar Live,\" and description.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 802378745
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
