  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing UI/UX Goals**\n\nI\'ve successfully compiled the applet. Now, I\'m diving into the user\'s specific UI/UX requirements. The first point involves a sticky header with a textual logo, similar to an ABP-style interface. I\'m considering options like \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\244 \340\244\270\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\232\340\244\276\340\244\260 LIVE,\" \"Bharat Samachar,\" or \"\340\244\246\340\245\207\340\244\266 \340\244\262\340\244\276\340\244\207\340\244\265 | DESH LIVE\" for the header text.\n\n\n**Defining Feature Priorities**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the app\'s features. I\'ve decided to incorporate bilingual labels, a live date/time display, and a weather indicator in the UI. Next, I am organizing the primary navigation into categories. The goal is a desktop scrollable menu, and a mobile hamburger drawer. Also, I need to design a breaking news ticker, and decide on a homepage layout that includes a hero story and secondary story grids.\n\n\n**Outlining Article Structure**\n\nI\'m now detailing the article page layout. I\'m focusing on features such as breadcrumbs, title with author details and publication info, and share buttons for easy distribution. Moreover, the design will include a hero image with captions, and a rich content body. I\'m also planning in-article ad placement. I\'ll include a tag list and a related stories grid to enhance the user experience.\n\n\n\n**Developing Feature Pages**\n\nI\'m currently focused on feature-specific pages. I\'m planning story cards with badges, and either pagination or a \"Load More\" button. Furthermore, a search page will feature instant live results, with filters. The video page will include duration pills and a \"More Videos\" rail, and the photo gallery will show photo counts with a full slideshow. Lastly, the design system will use a news portal color palette.\n\n\n**Designing Data Architecture**\n\nNow, I\'m defining the data layer, and have already planned the structure for categories, articles, videos, and galleries. I will populate data with realistic bilingual Indian news stories. I am implementing helper functions to retrieve, search, and sort article information. I\'m also preparing for the optional mini admin with basic functionality, including article status management.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 660887234
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
