  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Article Structures**\n\nI\'m currently focused on structuring the foundational `Article` type within `src/types.ts`. I\'m meticulously defining each property: `id`, `slug`, `idSlug`, bilingual titles and excerpts, along with category and author details including name, role, and avatar. My priority is ensuring a clean, modular design from the get-go.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Structures**\n\nI\'ve expanded the data structures now, incorporating `publishedAt`, `readTime`, `coverImage`, `caption`, and `tags` into the `Article` type. I\'m also including `body`, `isBreaking`, `isTrending`, `views`, and `keyPoints`. I\'m also defining categories with their specific attributes like `color` and `description`. I am also working on VideoItem and PhotoGallery structures. I\'m focusing on navigation links, filter states, and router context. I will be working on a demo data set soon.\n\n\n**Developing Data Handling**\n\nI\'m now integrating robust helper functions such as `getArticleByIdSlug` and `searchArticles` to facilitate data retrieval and manipulation. I\'m also including `getTrendingArticles`, `getBreakingArticles`, and other functions for related content. I\'m working on routes for videos and photo galleries, aiming for dynamic content display with the client-side router, also working on admin routes.\n\n\n**Designing UI Components**\n\nI\'m deep in the UI components now, specifically the top header. I\'m focusing on features such as a live weather display and language toggle, along with a search trigger and admin shortcut. I am designing a brand banner with the bold \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\244 \340\244\270\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\232\340\244\276\340\244\260 LIVE\" logo and an interactive ad demo slot. Also, I am planning the primary navigation bar\'s layout.\n\n\n**Crafting UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now deeply immersed in UI component construction. I am working on the diverse `StoryCard` variations for different content presentations. I\'m building a robust `SectionBlock` with ABP-style category blocks. I am designing a `TrendingWidget` to highlight popular content, and a `ShareBar` with seamless social sharing integration. I will finish with `AdSlot.tsx`.\n\n\n**Constructing UI Layout**\n\nI\'m now making steady progress on `AdSlot.tsx`, meticulously crafting a demo with IAB responsive sizes and placeholder visuals. Also, I\'m working on the `Footer.tsx` with a full ABP-style layout including comprehensive details. Further, I\'ve developed `ImageWithFallback.tsx` mimicking Next.js\' image component, complete with blur placeholders and fallback options. I\'m focusing on the `HomePage.tsx` now, structuring it with the hero story, sidebars, and various category sections.\n\n\n**Implementing Article Display**\n\nI\'m now implementing the display logic for individual articles, focusing on a dynamic loading system using the `idSlug`. The article view now includes breadcrumbs, a headline in Hindi with an English subheadline, author details, publication timestamps, and an audio preview widget, adding features such as a font size adjuster. I have integrated a hero image with a caption, a key highlights box, full article body with blockquotes, and in-article ad placement, along with a sticky share bar, a tag cloud, and a related stories grid. Additionally, I\'m working on the design and implementation of category-specific pages with dynamic features. I\'m building live search functionality with instant filtering for the search page.\n\n\n**Refining Search and Media**\n\nI\'m currently refining the search functionality, implementing a results grid with keyword highlighting, and designing an empty state with suggested queries to enhance user experience. I\'ve also focused on the `VideoListPage.tsx`, `VideoDetailPage.tsx`, `PhotoListPage.tsx`, and `PhotoDetailPage.tsx` pages. I am focusing on the video portal layout with play badges and duration indicators, as well as the detailed view with a responsive YouTube player. I am working on building photo gallery grids, and interactive slideshows with prev/next controls, caption and slide counters, and a fullscreen mode.\n\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 7
      nanos: 653895506
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
