  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing The Homepage**\n\nI\'m now deep in creating the `HomePage.tsx`. I\'ve outlined the structure, envisioning a hero story leading, followed by a grid of secondary features, then category sections: National, Politics, Cricket, Entertainment, and Tech. Each section will have three story cards and a \'More\' link.\n\n\n**Defining Article Pages**\n\nI\'ve shifted focus to `src/pages/ArticlePage.tsx`. This includes breadcrumbs, a prominent title (both Hindi and English), author details, time, and a font size adjuster. I\'m also planning for an audio read preview and share buttons. The layout incorporates a hero image with caption, body content with highlights and quotes, an in-article ad, a tag cloud, and related stories. I\'m also considering the content and design of related story cards.\n\n\n"
