    thinking: "**Achieving Initial Cleanliness**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that `lint_applet` is entirely error-free, a major milestone! My focus has now shifted to crafting a detailed `README.md` file, which is crucial for setup and deployment instructions on Vercel. I intend to maintain clean, modular, and production-like code, incorporating demo data as requested.\n\n\n**Expanding Documentation Scope**\n\nI\'ve expanded the `README.md` outline considerably. It now includes detailed sections for Project Overview, Architecture, Tech Stack (specifying Next.js 15+ App Router, React 19, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS), and a thorough list of implemented features. These features span from the sticky header to the mini Newsroom Admin, and I am documenting each.\n\n\n"
