      replacement_content: "# \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\244 \340\244\270\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\232\340\244\276\340\244\260 LIVE | Bharat Samachar Live (ABP-Style Inspired Demo News Portal)\n\nA high-performance, modern Indian News Portal web application inspired by the design principles and fast-paced layout of prominent Indian news portals (ABP Live style), built with original styling, typography, and placeholder assets.\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\214\237 Key Features\n\n### 1. Sticky Header & Navigation\n- **Bilingual Identity:** Hindi & English bilingual labels across all navigation headers.\n- **Top Utility Bar:** Live date (`\340\244\227\340\245\201\340\244\260\340\245\201\340\244\265\340\244\276\340\244\260, 3 \340\244\270\340\244\277\340\244\244\340\244\202\340\244\254\340\244\260 2026`), current weather (`\340\244\250\340\244\210 \340\244\246\340\244\277\340\244\262\340\245\215\340\244\262\340\245\200 32\302\260C`), live TV indicator, language toggle, and newsroom admin shortcut.\n- **Sticky Red Navigation:** Horizontal category tabs (\340\244\246\340\245\207\340\244\266, \340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\234\340\244\250\340\245\200\340\244\244\340\244\277, \340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\245\207\340\244\237, \340\244\256\340\244\250\340\245\213\340\244\260\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\250, \340\244\265\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\252\340\244\276\340\244\260, \340\244\244\340\244\225\340\244\250\340\245\200\340\244\225, \340\244\246\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276, \340\244\262\340\244\276\340\244\207\340\244\253\340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\237\340\244\276\340\244\207\340\244\262) with active route indicator and instant search toggle.\n- **Mobile Drawer:** Responsive slide-over hamburger navigation drawer with category list, search, and social links.\n\n### 2. Breaking News Ticker (\340\244\254\340\244\241\340\244\274\340\245\200 \340\244\226\340\244\254\340\244\260)\n- High-contrast black bar with a pulsing red `\342\232\241 \340\244\254\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\225\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\227 \340\244\250\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\245\202\340\244\234\340\244\274 / BREAKING` badge.\n- Interactive headline carousel with auto-rotation, hover-to-pause, next/previous controls, and direct links to breaking news articles.\n\n### 3. Homepage Architecture\n- **Hero Lead Story:** Large card with live update badge, high-resolution visual, excerpt, author byline, and timestamp.\n- **Secondary Stories Grid:** Side-by-side featured stories with category badges and reading time.\n- **Category Sections:** Dedicated blocks for National, Politics, Cricket, Entertainment, Tech, and Business (each with 3 story cards + \"\340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\246\340\245\207\340\244\226\340\245\207\340\244\202 / View More\" link).\n- **Trending / Most Read Sidebar:** Top 5 articles ranked with numbered badges, reader view counts, and popular trending tags (#ISRO, #Gaganyaan, #INDvsAUS, #Budget2026).\n- **Multimedia Spotlight:** Embedded video rail and photo gallery teasers.\n- **Standardized Ad Slots:** Tastefully integrated IAB-standard demo ad placements (728x90 Leaderboard, 300x250 Medium Rectangle, 300x600 Half-Page, In-Feed banner).\n\n### 4. Article Page (`/news/[idSlug]`)\n- Breadcrumbs: `\340\244\271\340\245\213\340\244\256 > \340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\234\340\244\250\340\245\200\340\244\244\340\244\277 > ...`\n- Dual Hindi headline and English subtitle.\n- Author byline with avatar, designation, publication timestamp, and total views.\n- **Interactive Accessibility:** Font size resizer (`A-`, `A`, `A+`) and demo text-to-speech audio reader player (\"\340\244\226\340\244\254\340\244\260 \340\244\270\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\245\207\340\244\202 / Listen\").\n- **Social Share Bar:** Pre-configured URL-encoded sharing for WhatsApp, X (Twitter), Facebook, LinkedIn, and 1-click clipboard copy.\n- Hero image with caption & photographer credit.\n- **Key Highlights (\340\244\256\340\245\201\340\244\226\340\245\215\340\244\257 \340\244\254\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\201):** Structured summary box.\n- Formatted body paragraphs with blockquote and mid-article sponsor placement.\n- Clickable tags cloud and 3-card related stories grid.\n\n### 5. Category Page (`/category/[slug]`)\n- Custom category header with Hindi/English title, description, and total article count.\n- Featured horizontal story card + 2-column grid.\n- Interactive \"\340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\262\340\245\213\340\244\241 \340\244\225\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\202 (Load More)\" button.\n- Sidebar with category trending stories and ad slots.\n\n### 6. Search Portal (`/search`)\n- Client-side instant search filtering by headline, excerpt, category, and tags.\n- Category dropdown filter and sort option (Latest vs Most Read).\n- Live result count, clear query button, and clickable suggestion chips.\n\n### 7. Video Portal (`/videos` & `/videos/[idSlug]`)\n- Video listing with duration pills, play icon overlay, and view counters.\n- Detail page with responsive 16:9 embedded YouTube player (demo IDs), description, and \"\340\244\205\340\244\227\340\244\262\340\244\276 \340\244\265\340\245\200\340\244\241\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\245\213 / Next Videos\" rail.\n\n### 8. Photo Gallery (`/photos` & `/photos/[idSlug]`)\n- Gallery grid with photo count badges (e.g., \"8 \340\244\244\340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\265\340\245\200\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\202\").\n- Detail view with interactive slideshow: previous/next arrows, thumbnail strip for instant jumping, slide counter (`\340\244\244\340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\265\340\245\200\340\244\260 3 / 8`), fullscreen mode toggle, and per-slide Hindi/English captions.\n\n### 9. Mini Newsroom Admin (`/admin`)\n- Pitch-ready editorial dashboard: Metrics for Total Articles, Breaking News, Estimated Readers, and Categories.\n- Filterable article management table with live status badges.\n- **\"\340\244\250\340\244\210 \340\244\226\340\244\254\340\244\260 \340\244\234\340\245\213\340\244\241\340\244\274\340\245\207\340\244\202 (Create Article)\" Form:** Input Hindi headline, English subtitle, category, excerpt, body paragraphs, cover image with quick presets, breaking news toggle, and trending toggle.\n- Automatically publishes to live state so you can immediately view your created article across the homepage, ticker, and category pages!\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Tech Stack & Typography\n\n- **Framework:** React 19 / Vite + Next.js 15 App Router architecture pattern\n- **Language:** TypeScript 5.8\n- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS v4\n- **Icons:** `lucide-react`\n- **Typography:** Google Fonts:\n  - `Noto Sans Devanagari` & `Hind` for Hindi typography\n  - `Plus Jakarta Sans` for English numerals and body copy\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\232\200 Running Locally\n\n```bash\n# 1. Clone repository & install dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# 2. Start development server\nnpm run dev\n\n# App will be accessible at http://localhost:3000\n```\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\214\220 Deploying to Vercel (Next.js / Vite)\n\n### Deploying with Vercel CLI\n```bash\n# Install Vercel CLI\nnpm i -g vercel\n\n# Deploy\nvercel\n```\n\n### Deploying via GitHub to Vercel\n1. Push this repository to GitHub.\n2. Log in to [Vercel](https://vercel.com/) and click **\"Add New Project\"**.\n3. Import your GitHub repository.\n4. Framework Preset: Choose **Vite** or **Next.js**.\n5. Build Command: `npm run build`\n6. Output Directory: `dist`\n7. Click **Deploy**.\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\223\201 Complete Project Structure\n\n```\nbharat-samachar-live/\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 public/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 robots.txt\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 sitemap.xml\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 AdSlot.tsx              # Standardized IAB Ad placeholders\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 BreakingTicker.tsx      # Animated marquee breaking news bar\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Footer.tsx              # Comprehensive Indian news portal footer\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Header.tsx              # Sticky header, bilingual nav, mobile drawer\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ImageWithFallback.tsx   # Next/image equivalent image component\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 SectionBlock.tsx        # 3-card category block with \"More\" link\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ShareBar.tsx            # WhatsApp, X, FB, LinkedIn sharing\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 StoryCard.tsx           # Hero, secondary, horizontal, compact cards\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 TrendingWidget.tsx      # Ranked top 5 stories & trending tags\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 context/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 RouterContext.tsx       # Dynamic client routing & metadata updates\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 data/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 demo.ts                 # 20+ Hindi articles, 8 videos, 6 galleries\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 pages/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 AdminPage.tsx           # Demo editorial dashboard & article creation\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ArticlePage.tsx         # Full article detail with audio & highlights\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 CategoryPage.tsx        # Category story grid with load more\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 HomePage.tsx            # Main news homepage with hero & sections\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 PhotoDetailPage.tsx     # Full slideshow gallery with thumbnails\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 PhotoListPage.tsx       # Photo galleries list\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 SearchPage.tsx          # Instant client-side search & filters\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 VideoDetailPage.tsx     # Embedded YouTube player & more videos\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 VideoListPage.tsx       # Video list grid\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.tsx                     # Main layout & route router\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.css                   # Tailwind v4 directives & font definitions\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 main.tsx                    # React DOM entry point\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 types.ts                    # TypeScript interfaces for News Portal\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.html                      # HTML entry with Google Fonts & metadata\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 metadata.json                   # Applet configuration metadata\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json                    # Project dependencies & scripts\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 README.md                       # Documentation & deployment guide\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.json                   # TypeScript configuration\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 vite.config.ts                  # Vite + Tailwind configuration\n```\n"
