224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 AdminPage.tsx           # Demo editorial dashboard & article creation\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ArticlePage.tsx         # Full article detail with audio & highlights\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 CategoryPage.tsx        # Category story grid with load more\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 HomePage.tsx            # Main news homepage with hero & sections\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 PhotoDetailPage.tsx     # Full slideshow gallery with thumbnails\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 PhotoListPage.tsx       # Photo galleries list\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 SearchPage.tsx          # Instant client-side search & filters\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 VideoDetailPage.tsx     # Embedded YouTube player & more videos\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 VideoListPage.tsx       # Video list grid\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.tsx                     # Main layout & route router\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.css                   # Tailwind v4 directives & font definitions\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 main.tsx                    # React DOM entry point\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 types.ts                    # TypeScript interfaces for News Portal\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 index.html                      # HTML entry with Google Fonts & metadata\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 metadata.json                   # Applet configuration metadata\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json                    # Project dependencies & scripts\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 README.md                       # Documentation & deployment guide\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.json                   # TypeScript configuration\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 vite.config.ts                  # Vite + Tailwind configuration\n```\n\n---\n\n### Implementation Overview\n\nI have built **\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\244 \340\244\270\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\232\340\244\276\340\244\260 LIVE (Bharat Samachar Live)**, a demo Indian news portal web application inspired by the fast-paced, high-impact aesthetic of leading Indian news portals (such as ABP Live) with original branding, Hindi Devanagari typography, and placeholder assets:\n\n1. **Brand Identity & Typography**\n   - **Indian News Red Theme**: Styled with a primary crimson palette (`#e11d48` / `#dc2626`), clean neutral light grays, and black-accented breaking news badges.\n   - **Devanagari Font System**: Loaded Google Fonts (`Noto Sans Devanagari` and `Hind`) paired with `Plus Jakarta Sans` for clean, readable bilingual headlines, body copy, and metadata stamps.\n\n2. **Sticky Header & Breaking News Ticker**\n   - **Sticky Top Nav**: Features live date formatting (`\340\244\227\340\245\201\340\244\260\340\245\201\340\244\265\340\244\276\340\244\260, 3 \340\244\270\340\244\277\340\244\244\340\244\202\340\244\254\340\244\260 2026`), live weather widget (`\340\244\250\340\244\210 \340\244\246\340\244\277\340\244\262\340\245\215\340\244\262\340\245\200 32\302\260C`), live TV badge, language switch, and newsroom admin shortcut.\n   - **Category Navigation**: Horizontal scrolling category links (\340\244\246\340\245\207\340\244\266, \340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\234\340\244\250\340\245\200\340\244\244\340\244\277, \340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\245\207\340\244\237, \340\244\256\340\244\250\340\245\213\340\244\260\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\250, \340\244\265\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\252\340\244\276\340\244\260, \340\244\244\340\244\225\340\244\250\340\245\200\340\244\225, \340\244\246\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276, \340\244\262\340\244\276\340\244\207\340\244\253\340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\237\340\244\276\340\244\207\340\244\262, \340\244\265\340\245\200\340\244\241\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\245\213, \340\244\253\340\245\213\340\244\237\340\245\213) with active indicator and responsive mobile slide-out drawer.\n   - **Breaking News Marquee**: Black bar with a pulsing red `\342\232\241 \340\244\254\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\225\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\227 \340\244\250\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\245\202\340\244\234\340\244\274 / BREAKING` badge, auto-rotating headlines, pause on hover, next/previous buttons, and direct article routing.\n\n3. **Homepage Layout**\n   - **Hero Lead Card**: Prominent lead story with live update badge, excerpt, author byline, and timestamp.\n   - **Secondary Grid**: 3-story featured row with category tags and reading times.\n   - **Category Sections**: Dedicated section blocks for National, Politics, Cricket, Entertainment, Tech, and Business (each with 3 story cards + \"\340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\246\340\245\207\340\244\226\340\245\207\340\244\202 / View More\" link).\n   - **Trending / Most Read Sidebar**: Top 5 ranked articles with numbered badges, view counts, and trending tag pills (#ISRO, #Gaganyaan, #INDvsAUS, #Budget2026).\n   - **Multimedia Highlights**: Embedded video highlights rail and photo gallery teasers.\n   - **IAB Ad Placeholders**: Clearly labeled `\"Ad Slot (Demo) / \340\244\265\340\244\277\340\244\234\340\245\215\340\244\236\340\244\276\340\244\252\340\244\250 (\340\244\241\340\245\207\340\244\256\340\245\213)\"` across 728x90 leaderboard, 300x250 rectangle, 300x600 half-page, and in-feed formats.\n\n4. **Rich Article Experience (`/news/[idSlug]`)**\n   - Breadcrumb navigation (`\340\244\271\340\245\213\340\244\256 > \340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\234\340\244\250\340\245\200\340\244\244\340\244\277 > ...`).\n   - Dual Hindi headline and English subtitle, author avatar, designation, publication timestamp, and total views.\n   - **Accessibility Toolbar**: Font size resizer (`A-`, `A`, `A+`) and audio article reader preview (`\340\244\226\340\244\254\340\244\260 \340\244\270\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\245\207\340\244\202 / Listen`).\n   - **Pre-encoded Share Bar**: Direct 1-click sharing to WhatsApp (`api.whatsapp.com/send`), X (Twitter), Facebook, LinkedIn, and copy-link with feedback.\n   - Hero image with caption, key highlights box (\340\244\256\340\245\201\340\244\226\340\245\215\340\244\257 \340\244\254\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\201), structured body paragraphs, blockquotes, mid-article ad slot, and 3-card related stories grid.\n\n5. **Category & Instant Search Pages**\n   - **Category Page (`/category/[slug]`)**: Category banner, story count, horizontal featured card, 2-column grid, and \"\340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\262\340\245\213\340\244\241 \340\244\225\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\202 (Load More)\" button.\n   - **Search Page (`/search`)**: Instant client-side search across headlines, excerpts, and tags, with category dropdown filter, sorting (Latest vs Most Read), and quick suggestion chips.\n\n6. **Multimedia: Video & Photo Portals**\n   - **Video Portal (`/videos` & `/videos/[idSlug]`)**: Video list with duration pills and view counts; detail page with a responsive 16:9 embedded YouTube player and \"\340\244\205\340\244\227\340\244\262\340\244\276 \340\244\265\340\245\200\340\244\241\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\245\213 / Next Videos\" rail.\n   - **Photo Gallery (`/photos` & `/photos/[idSlug]`)**: Photo gallery list with count pills; detail page with an interactive slideshow, prev/next controls, thumbnail navigation strip, fullscreen toggle, and bilingual captions.\n\n7. **Newsroom Admin (`/admin`)**\n   - Pitch-ready editorial dashboard with article count, breaking stories count, and total reader views.\n   - Manageable article table with live status badges.\n   - \"\340\244\250\340\244\210 \340\244\226\340\244\254\340\244\260 \340\244\234\340\245\213\340\244\241\340\244\274\340\245\207\340\244\202 (Create Article)\" form with bilingual labels to publish new articles to state and view them immediately on the homepage and ticker.\n\n---\n\n### Setup & Running\n\n```bash\n# 1. Install dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# 2. Start development server\nnpm run dev\n# The application will be running at http://localhost:3000\n```"
