  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing the Dashboard**\n\nI\'m now focusing on transforming `AdminPage.tsx` into a robust WordPress article management dashboard. The initial top header\'s title will be \"WordPress \340\244\206\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\237\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\244\262 \340\244\256\340\245\210\340\244\250\340\245\207\340\244\234\340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\202\340\244\237 \340\244\241\340\245\210\340\244\266\340\244\254\340\245\213\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\241 (WP Admin & SEO Assistant).\" The subtitle is still under consideration, though.\n\n\n**Defining Dashboard Features**\n\nI\'ve been concentrating on integrating key SEO metrics from Yoast/Rank Math, Flesch Readability, and heading hierarchy (H1-H3) into the WordPress dashboard. I am also working on Quick Actions such as \"\342\234\215\357\270\217 Create Article\" and \"\360\237\244\226 Open AI Assistant.\" The Metrics Bar will display key counts, and an SEO health score. I\'m prioritizing the \"All Articles\" tab, a table view with post details: title, status, SEO/Readability scores, views, and actions such as edit, view, and delete.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 20
      nanos: 192399453
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
