  planner_response {
    response: "I have integrated an **Advanced WordPress Article Management Assistant** into the admin panel, complete with Yoast & Rank Math SEO compatibility, readability auditing, heading hierarchy controls, and safety protocols:\n\n### 1. WordPress Article Creation & Management\n- **Structured Content Formats**: Support for standard news reports, tutorials, reviews, listicles, and breaking news alerts with tailored metadata schemas.\n- **H1, H2, H3 Heading Hierarchy**: Gutenberg-style block editor with quick-insert buttons for H2 sections, H3 subheadings, paragraphs, bulleted lists, and quotes, ensuring compliant single-H1 page structures.\n- **Full Field Validation**: Enforces mandatory fields (headlines, meta descriptions, categories, and scheduled dates) before saving to prevent malformed posts.\n\n### 2. Yoast & Rank Math SEO Optimization Engine\n- **Live SEO Scoring (100-Point Audit)**: Real-time analysis checking focus keyword placement in titles, meta descriptions, URL slugs, and opening paragraphs.\n- **Keyword Density & Length Monitor**: Keeps keyword density within the optimal 1.0%\342\200\2232.5% range and tracks 50\342\200\22360 character titles and 150\342\200\223160 character meta descriptions with a visual progress meter.\n- **SERP Snippet Preview**: Live Google search result simulation with instant desktop and mobile toggle views.\n- **Permalink Slug Generator**: One-click generation of clean, SEO-friendly permalinks from headlines or target keywords.\n- **Media & Accessibility**: Featured image management with dedicated Alt-text validation containing focus keywords.\n\n### 3. Content Quality & Readability Auditing\n- **Flesch Reading Ease Formula**: Calculates syllable-to-word and word-to-sentence ratios with qualitative reading grade classifications (e.g., standard, easy, complex).\n- **Duplicate Phrase Detection**: Scans content paragraphs for repeated sentence structures to maintain editorial originality.\n- **Linking Recommendations**: Actionable suggestions for internal archive linking and authoritative external references.\n\n### 4. Post Status & Publication Scheduling\n- **Lifecycle Statuses**: Dedicated controls for **Draft**, **Published**, **Pending Review**, and **Scheduled** posts.\n- **Date & Time Picker**: Enables automated future publishing schedules visible in the admin post table.\n- **Local Persistence**: Integrated browser storage retains newly authored drafts, scheduled articles, edits, and deletions across page refreshes.\n\n### 5. Conversational AI Assistant & Safety Protocols\n- **Multilingual Support**: Switch seamlessly between **\340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\250\340\245\215\340\244\246\340\245\200 (Hindi)**, **Hinglish**, and **English**.\n- **Quick-Action Chips**: One-tap prompts for SEO audits, H1/H2/H3 restructuring, 150-character meta drafting, and post generation.\n- **Progress Tracking**: Step-by-step progress feedback during multi-stage generation tasks.\n- **Destructive Action Safety**: Enforces an explicit double-confirmation modal before any post can be permanently deleted or moved to trash."
    modified_response: "I have integrated an **Advanced WordPress Article Management Assistant** into the admin panel, complete with Yoast & Rank Math SEO compatibility, readability auditing, heading hierarchy controls, and safety protocols:\n\n### 1. WordPress Article Creation & Management\n- **Structured Content Formats**: Support for standard news reports, tutorials, reviews, listicles, and breaking news alerts with tailored metadata schemas.\n- **H1, H2, H3 Heading Hierarchy**: Gutenberg-style block editor with quick-insert buttons for H2 sections, H3 subheadings, paragraphs, bulleted lists, and quotes, ensuring compliant single-H1 page structures.\n- **Full Field Validation**: Enforces mandatory fields (headlines, meta descriptions, categories, and scheduled dates) before saving to prevent malformed posts.\n\n### 2. Yoast & Rank Math SEO Optimization Engine\n- **Live SEO Scoring (100-Point Audit)**: Real-time analysis checking focus keyword placement in titles, meta descriptions, URL slugs, and opening paragraphs.\n- **Keyword Density & Length Monitor**: Keeps keyword density within the optimal 1.0%\342\200\2232.5% range and tracks 50\342\200\22360 character titles and 150\342\200\223160 character meta descriptions with a visual progress meter.\n- **SERP Snippet Preview**: Live Google search result simulation with instant desktop and mobile toggle views.\n- **Permalink Slug Generator**: One-click generation of clean, SEO-friendly permalinks from headlines or target keywords.\n- **Media & Accessibility**: Featured image management with dedicated Alt-text validation containing focus keywords.\n\n### 3. Content Quality & Readability Auditing\n- **Flesch Reading Ease Formula**: Calculates syllable-to-word and word-to-sentence ratios with qualitative reading grade classifications (e.g., standard, easy, complex).\n- **Duplicate Phrase Detection**: Scans content paragraphs for repeated sentence structures to maintain editorial originality.\n- **Linking Recommendations**: Actionable suggestions for internal archive linking and authoritative external references.\n\n### 4. Post Status & Publication Scheduling\n- **Lifecycle Statuses**: Dedicated controls for **Draft**, **Published**, **Pending Review**, and **Scheduled** posts.\n- **Date & Time Picker**: Enables automated future publishing schedules visible in the admin post table.\n- **Local Persistence**: Integrated browser storage retains newly authored drafts, scheduled articles, edits, and deletions across page refreshes.\n\n### 5. Conversational AI Assistant & Safety Protocols\n- **Multilingual Support**: Switch seamlessly between **\340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\250\340\245\215\340\244\246\340\245\200 (Hindi)**, **Hinglish**, and **English**.\n- **Quick-Action Chips**: One-tap prompts for SEO audits, H1/H2/H3 restructuring, 150-character meta drafting, and post generation.\n- **Progress Tracking**: Step-by-step progress feedback during multi-stage generation tasks.\n- **Destructive Action Safety**: Enforces an explicit double-confirmation modal before any post can be permanently deleted or moved to trash."
