  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Localization Implementation**\n\nI\'ve been examining `Header.tsx`. I noticed an opportunity to improve the language handling. Specifically, line 168 needs conditional rendering for the \"Home\" label, and line 181 requires similar logic to display either the English or Hindi category name based on the `lang` variable. This will fix the current language display issue.\n\n\n**Implementing Language-Specific Rendering**\n\nI\'ve extended the conditional rendering strategy within `Header.tsx`. I\'ve applied the `lang` variable checks to lines 194, 204, 216, 75, and 95, implementing language-specific translations for \"Videos,\" \"Photos,\" \"Search,\" \"Live TV,\" and \"Admin (Demo).\" I\'ve also implemented the date formatting as well as a temperature rendering adjustment based on the selected language. Finally, I\'m thinking through the localization of the brand logo and subtext.\n\n\n**Refining Language Toggle Logic**\n\nI\'m focused on the language toggle button\'s implementation. The goal is a highly visible and intuitive button, potentially a toggle displaying `[ \340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200 | English ]` or a dynamic button reflecting the current language for instant toggling, placed in both the top utility bar and mobile menu. This triggers a full site-wide language change to Hindi when selected, ensuring all elements, including headers, tickers, and home page content, are rendered in Hindi. This switch also impacts items such as date format, search bar placeholder text, and section block labels.\n\n\n**Expanding Localization Scope**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the broader implications of localization across the application. I\'m focusing on rendering Hindi content throughout key components. This includes translating various components and elements like story cards with Hindi titles and excerpts, trending widgets displaying \"\340\244\237\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\202\340\244\241\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\227 \340\244\226\340\244\254\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\202,\" and section block titles, \"\340\244\270\340\244\255\340\245\200 \340\244\246\340\245\207\340\244\226\340\245\207\340\244\202 \342\206\222\" in Hindi. I\'m considering components like the search page, admin page, footer, article and video pages, all with their titles, labels, placeholders, and descriptions. All now updated!\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 826837191
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
