    thinking: "**Implementing Language Preferences**\n\nI\'m currently working on incorporating language preferences into the application. The goal is to initialize the language setting from local storage, defaulting to Hindi if nothing is stored. I also want to ensure that any language changes are persistently saved to local storage, allowing us to maintain the user\'s preferred language across sessions. I\'ll import translations and make the available translations dependent on the language in use.\n\n\n"
