r; the label for this is `t.quickActionsLabel`, and the \"New Article\" button translation is `t.btnNewArticle`.\n\n\n**Integrating Quick Actions Buttons**\n\nI\'m now adding some new quick action buttons to the dashboard! I\'ve added button translations for Templates (`t.btnTemplates`), SEO Audit (`t.btnSeoAudit`), Schedule (`t.btnSchedule`), and AI Enhancer (`t.btnAiEnhancer`). I\'m adding the code, and their respective icons, to build the suite navigation.\n\n\n**Modernizing Suite Header**\n\nI\'m now overhauling the Suite Header. I\'m focusing on a lighter, more modern feel, moving away from the dark theme. I\'ve updated the background to white with a subtle border and refined the title and subtitle styling for improved clarity. I\'m also updating active post selector and action buttons to a clean design.\n\n\n**Organizing Suite Navigation**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the sidebar structure. I\'m grouping the 12 items into 5 clear categories with sub-tabs. I\'m grouping the following sections into 5 sleek tabs in the sidebar: Overview & Analytics, Article Creation, SEO & AI Tools, Media & Scheduling, and Workflow & Revisions. \"Article Creation\" will have a pill switcher for the creation wizard and templates.\n\n\n"
